Input: {"question": "Which person or organization did Mai Hassan work for?", "original_source_segments": {"D1S1": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 0, "end": 78, "text": "Here is a narrative that weaves in detailed evidence supporting the statement:"}, "D1S2": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 80, "end": 122, "text": "Title: The Academic Pursuits of Mai Hassan"}, "D1S3": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 124, "end": 268, "text": "In the heart of Ann Arbor, Michigan, the University of Michigan stood as a beacon of academic excellence, attracting scholars from far and wide."}, "D1S4": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 269, "end": 438, "text": "Among them was Mai Hassan, a renowned American professor of political science, whose intellectual curiosity and passion for teaching led her to the esteemed institution."}, "D1S5": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 439, "end": 605, "text": "As a respected expert in her field, Mai Hassan's academic journey was marked by a series of accomplishments that ultimately brought her to the University of Michigan."}, "D1S6": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 606, "end": 767, "text": "Her research interests, which spanned from comparative politics to international relations, resonated with the university's strong programs in political science."}, "D1S7": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 768, "end": 869, "text": "It was only a matter of time before she would join the faculty ranks of this prestigious institution."}, "D1S8": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 870, "end": 1004, "text": "A cursory glance at Mai Hassan's curriculum vitae reveals a trail of academic appointments that led her to the University of Michigan."}, "D1S9": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1005, "end": 1175, "text": "Prior to her tenure at Michigan, she held positions at other esteemed institutions, where she taught courses on political economy, democratization, and global governance."}, "D1S10": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1176, "end": 1331, "text": "Her scholarly articles, published in top-tier journals, demonstrated her expertise in analyzing the complex dynamics of political systems and institutions."}, "D1S11": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1332, "end": 1498, "text": "In 2015, Mai Hassan's academic trajectory took a significant turn when she was appointed as an assistant professor of political science at the University of Michigan."}, "D1S12": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1499, "end": 1633, "text": "This milestone marked the beginning of a fruitful collaboration between Hassan and the university, which would last for several years."}, "D1S13": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1634, "end": 1785, "text": "During her tenure, she taught a range of courses, from introductory classes on American politics to advanced seminars on comparative political economy."}, "D1S14": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1786, "end": 1954, "text": "One of the most compelling pieces of evidence supporting Mai Hassan's affiliation with the University of Michigan is her presence on the university's faculty directory."}, "D1S15": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1955, "end": 2134, "text": "A simple search on the university's website yields a profile page dedicated to Hassan, complete with her contact information, research interests, and a list of courses she taught."}, "D1S16": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2135, "end": 2245, "text": "This digital footprint serves as a testament to her status as a member of the university's academic community."}, "D1S17": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2246, "end": 2475, "text": "Furthermore, a review of the University of Michigan's departmental newsletters and announcements from the mid-2010s reveals frequent mentions of Mai Hassan's research projects, conference presentations, and academic achievements."}, "D1S18": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2476, "end": 2618, "text": "These mentions not only demonstrate her active involvement in the department but also highlight the university's pride in her accomplishments."}, "D1S19": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2619, "end": 2753, "text": "In addition to her teaching and research responsibilities, Mai Hassan was an active participant in the university's intellectual life."}, "D1S20": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2754, "end": 2924, "text": "She regularly attended seminars, workshops, and conferences organized by the political science department, engaging in lively debates and discussions with her colleagues."}, "D2S1": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 0, "end": 202, "text": "As the sun dipped behind the Sierra Nevada mountains, casting a warm orange glow over the campus of the University of Nevada, Reno, Mai Hassan made her way to her office in the Social Sciences building."}, "D2S2": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 203, "end": 354, "text": "The crunch of gravel beneath her feet was a familiar sound, one that had become synonymous with the start of another busy day of teaching and research."}, "D2S3": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 355, "end": 443, "text": "Mai, a renowned professor of political science, had called UNR home for nearly a decade."}, "D2S4": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 444, "end": 655, "text": "Her expertise in Middle Eastern politics had drawn students from all over the country, and her passion for fostering critical thinking had earned her a reputation as one of the most beloved professors on campus."}, "D2S5": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 656, "end": 802, "text": "As she settled into her office, surrounded by stacks of dog-eared books and scattered notes, Mai's gaze fell upon a framed photograph on her desk."}, "D2S6": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 803, "end": 892, "text": "It was a snapshot of her graduate school days at Berkeley, where she had earned her Ph.D."}, "D2S7": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 893, "end": 914, "text": "in political science."}, "D2S8": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 915, "end": 1086, "text": "The memories came flooding back – late-night study sessions, heated debates with her cohort, and the sense of accomplishment that had come with defending her dissertation."}, "D2S9": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1087, "end": 1142, "text": "Mai's thoughts were interrupted by a knock at the door."}, "D2S10": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1143, "end": 1278, "text": "It was her teaching assistant, Alex, a bright and ambitious undergraduate student who was helping Mai with her latest research project."}, "D2S11": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1279, "end": 1431, "text": "\"Professor Hassan, I've finished compiling the data on voter turnout in the 2016 presidential election,\" Alex said, handing Mai a thick stack of papers."}, "D2S12": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1432, "end": 1546, "text": "As Mai began to sift through the data, her mind began to wander back to her own experiences as a graduate student."}, "D2S13": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1547, "end": 1712, "text": "She had always been drawn to the intricacies of political systems, and her time at Berkeley had provided her with the perfect environment to explore those interests."}, "D2S14": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1713, "end": 1865, "text": "It was there that she had developed her expertise in Middle Eastern politics, and it was there that she had laid the foundation for her future research."}, "D2S15": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1866, "end": 1924, "text": "The sound of Alex's voice brought Mai back to the present."}, "D2S16": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1925, "end": 2027, "text": "\"Professor Hassan, do you think we could discuss the implications of this data on our upcoming paper?\""}, "D2S17": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2028, "end": 2077, "text": "Mai smiled, her eyes lighting up with excitement."}, "D2S18": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2078, "end": 2096, "text": "\"Absolutely, Alex."}, "D2S19": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2097, "end": 2112, "text": "Let's dive in.\""}}, "original_cards": [{"doc_id": "d1", "card_id": "d1:c0", "entity": "Mai Hassan", "scope": "Employer", "claim": "Mai Hassan worked for the University of Michigan, where she was appointed as an assistant professor of political science in 2015.", "answer": "University of Michigan", "quote": "Among them was Mai Hassan, a renowned American professor of political science, whose intellectual curiosity and passion for teaching led her to the esteemed institution. As a respected expert in her field, Mai Hassan's academic journey was marked by a series of accomplishments that ultimately brought her to the University of Michigan. Her research interests, which spanned from comparative politics to international relations, resonated with the university's strong programs in political science. It was only a matter of time before she would join the faculty ranks of this prestigious institution. A cursory glance at Mai Hassan's curriculum vitae reveals a trail of academic appointments that led her to the University of Michigan. Prior to her tenure at Michigan, she held positions at other esteemed institutions, where she taught courses on political economy, democratization, and global governance. Her scholarly articles, published in top-tier journals, demonstrated her expertise in analyzing the complex dynamics of political systems and institutions. In 2015, Mai Hassan's academic trajectory took a significant turn when she was appointed as an assistant professor of political science at the University of Michigan.", "original_document_number": 1}, {"doc_id": "d2", "card_id": "d2:c0", "entity": "Mai Hassan", "scope": "Employer", "claim": "Mai Hassan worked for the University of Nevada, Reno, where she was a renowned professor of political science.", "answer": "University of Nevada, Reno", "quote": "As the sun dipped behind the Sierra Nevada mountains, casting a warm orange glow over the campus of the University of Nevada, Reno, Mai Hassan made her way to her office in the Social Sciences building. The crunch of gravel beneath her feet was a familiar sound, one that had become synonymous with the start of another busy day of teaching and research. Mai, a renowned professor of political science, had called UNR home for nearly a decade.", "original_document_number": 2}], "current_answers": ["University of Michigan", "University of Nevada, Reno"], "candidate_answers": [{"candidate_id": "R0", "answer": "University of Michigan", "origin": "initial"}, {"candidate_id": "R1", "answer": "University of Nevada, Reno", "origin": "initial"}]}

